OL,3,GNEWSARichard Hammond to 'find a way' to
OL,4,Ashare mansion with bats after
OL,5,Arenovation plans paused
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Top Gear star Richard Hammond
OL,8,Fhas said he will "find a way" of
OL,9,Fsharing his new #2m home with rare bats
OL,10,Fthat have paused his renovation plans.
OL,12,FWork to add a padel court and luxury
OL,13,Fcar garage hit the brakes after a
OL,14,Fsurvey found several species of bat,
OL,15,Fincluding the common pipistrelle and
OL,16,Fsoprano pipistrelles, foraging in the
OL,17,Fgrounds.
OL,19,FThe 56-year-old bought the 19th Century
OL,20,FGeorgian mansion in Llanwenarth, near
OL,21,FAbergavenny, in November 2025.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
