OL,3,GNEWSARichard Hammond to 'find a way' to
OL,4,Ashare mansion with bats after
OL,5,Arenovation plans paused
OL,6,
OL,7,F"If I have to share it with the bats,
OL,8,FI'll find a way of sharing it with the
OL,9,Fbats," Hammond told BBC Wales.
